30		The hypercube graph $C=(V,E)$ has vertex set $V=\F_q^m$, and an edge between $u$ and $v$ whenever they differ in at most one coordinate. A random edge $(u,v) \sim C$ is sampled by drawing $u \sim \F_q^m$, $i \in \{1,\dots,m\}$, and $x \in \F_q$ uniformly and then setting $v=\operatorname{rerand}_i(u,x)$.
